# Trial by Lightning (otherAreas 27): the battlefield entered while accepted, then the quest set available by GM
# inside the arena: the win's 32001 (canSkipCS 1, battlefieldWin not set) is finished while available: Heir of the
# Great Lightning and the Whisper of Storms all the same (the finish reads no status; kept Lua quirk). Ripapa,
# available at fame level 1 with the whisper: 10020.
char zone=CloisterOfStorms pos=533.5,-14.9,492.0 job=WAR lvl=75
quest OtherAreas.TrialByLightning accepted
keyitem TuningForkOfLightning
login
trigger LP_Entrance                       # accepted, the fork: 32000
update 32000 option=1                     # registered, entered, the fork taken
finish                                    # in the arena
quest OtherAreas.TrialByLightning available
kill LIGHTNING_GREMLIN-3                  # won while available: 32001 (canSkipCS 1)
finish                                    # Heir of the Great Lightning, the Whisper of Storms
warp 30.6,-15.6,56.0 Mhaura
trigger Ripapa                            # available, fame level 1, the whisper: 10020
finish
